  [1mThe fork:[0m the loading mechanism, which decides the file's export shape and whether the page keeps working from
  [38;5;153mfile://[39m.

  - [1mSecond script tag + global[0m — [38;5;153m<script src="settings.js">[39m before [38;5;153mapp.js[39m; settings.js sets [38;5;153mwindow.SETTINGS[39m. Matches the
